---
permalink: /sitemap.xml
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Built from collections.all, not a hand-maintained list, so a new page
    only needs its own front matter to show up here too. `addAllPagesToCollections:
    true` on service.njk's and stub.njk's pagination is what makes every one of
    their generated pages show up in collections.all rather than just the first.

    Deliberately excludes Demo Restaurant and Demo Detailer: they are
    addPassthroughCopy'd straight to _site/ rather than rendered as Eleventy
    templates, so they were never in collections.all to begin with, and that is
    exactly what we want — they present fictional local businesses with
    invented contact details and should not be indexed under this domain.

    Also excludes any page with `noindex: true` in its own front matter (e.g.
    /connect/, the QR business-card landing page) — same reasoning as its
    <meta name="robots"> tag, just applied here too, so the two never drift. -#}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- for p in collections.all %}
{%- if not p.data.noindex %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ p.url }}</loc>
    <priority>{{ p.url | sitemapPriority }}</priority>
  </url>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
